ns":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/669-hermes12","name":"Hermes12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar669_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T09:05:58-07:00","id":910117,"title":"","content":"So I finally got around to transferring charms from my excel file to the google docs one. There are now 114 new charms to browse through, bringing the total to about 340ish. I still have names for about another 120-130 charms that I intend to add, but they are all in the earliest stages of being conceptualised. I also intend to redo the charm tree images for all the abilities which are 'complete' to make them easier to navigate.<br /> <br /> Any and all comments and criticisms are welcome either here or on the doc itself <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My attempt at a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15dK8fZaL-Kn-yGKxW6VRg_z6aF27FqbIf-t8ZEXmMC4/edit?pref=2&amp;pli=1#\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal 3e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8793-grifftofer","name":"Grifftofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}